  "description": "Kang Bin, a teacher who has never been in a relati ve, but he misses the opportunity and is transferre d to his alma mater in his hometown. After an acci dental accident, he realizes that the place he wake s up to is his alma mater 15 years ago, and there h e meets himself and his friends 15 years ago... and his first love. At first he denied this unbelievable sit uation as a dream, but he thinks it was a reality an d an opportunity given by heaven. Unimaginable fantasy mystery romance!  \n(Source: KakaoPage)\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/55837189)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://piccoma.com/web/product/3330)",
